# UNLOCK — Product

UNLOCK is a Hebrew-first, RTL-first, mobile-first adaptive learning product.
Its core value is a longitudinal learner model that determines the next best learning action.

V1 priority: prove the real learning loop and pilot value, not generic LMS breadth.

Guardrails:
- Today/DailyPlan is the learner center;
- keep internal learning-engine complexity largely invisible to learners;
- instructor insights should reflect real learning evidence;
- AI may assist content workflows but is not the real-time Learning Engine;
- do not add deferred/non-goal features opportunistically.

Use `docs/UNLOCK_V1_SCOPE.md`, `MASTER_SPEC.md`, and relevant ADRs for exact decisions.
